@startuml
title Smart Recipe System - High-Level Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200

rectangle "Users" as Users {
  rectangle "Mobile App\n(Android & iOS UI)" as Mobile
}

node "Backend" as Backend {
  package "Spring Boot Core Services" as SpringBoot {
    package "Control Layer\n(REST Controllers)" as Control
    package "Service Layer" as Service
    package "Business Layer" as Business {
      component "Auth & Account\nManagement" as Auth
      component "Recipe Recognition\nOrchestrator" as Recog
      component "Text Search" as Search
      component "Health Analysis" as Health
      component "Personalized Nutrition\nAdvice" as Advice
      component "Diet Plan" as Diet
      component "Community Sharing\n& Interaction" as Community
      component "Recommendation\nEngine" as Reco
      component "Admin Review &\nRecipe Management" as AdminMgmt
      component "Merchant Map\nDisplay" as Map
    }
    package "Data Access Layer\n(DAO/Repository)" as DAL
  }
  node "Flask Model Inference Service" as Flask
}

database "MySQL" as MySQL
rectangle "Redis Cache" as Redis

' Connections
Mobile -[#1e88e5]-> Control : HTTP/Ajax API calls\n(login, search, recognition, share, recommend)
Control --> Service
Service --> Business
Business --> DAL
DAL --> MySQL : CRUD

' Caching and inference
Business -[#2e7d32]-> Redis : cache reads/writes
Business -[#6a1b9a]-> Flask : image vectors,\nmodel inference request
Flask --> Business : inference result

' Business modules data access
Auth --> DAL
Recog --> DAL
Search --> DAL
Health --> DAL
Advice --> DAL
Diet --> DAL
Community --> DAL
Reco --> DAL
AdminMgmt --> DAL
Map --> DAL

' External communications details
Mobile ..> Flask : image bytes may be proxied\nvia Spring Boot
Mobile ..> Redis : no direct access
Mobile ..> MySQL : no direct access

' Roles
note right of AdminMgmt
Requires administrator role:
- add recipes
- review user recipes
- batch user management
end note

' Constraints and platforms
note bottom of SpringBoot
- Implements main business logic (Spring Boot)
- Layers: Control, Service, Business, Data Access
- Exposes REST APIs to Mobile
end note

note bottom of Flask
Provides model inference for
photo-based recipe recognition
end note

note bottom of MySQL
Stores: users, login, recipes,
nutrition data, health info,
ingredients, taboos, comments,
merchants, recommendation features
end note

note bottom of Redis
Caches frequently accessed data
to improve performance
end note

' Security and assumptions
note top of Mobile
Login required for most operations
end note

@enduml